Z||000002||p4n1c||06-03-2001||10:30 AM||||But the thing is, the Internet is a gray area.  I'm in Canada if I threaten someone in the States or Russia, they can't do sh1t(Unless you want to call up the RCMP and start going through a long process to get them to even start looking into it).  Same as if someone in Brazil threatened me.  Threats on these types of forums are usually just hot air, or misinterpreted by the party reading the statement, just ignore them either way.<P>My .02..<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International<BR>2.8L MPFI V6/TH440-T4 OD auto<BR>"Ride the geriatric mobile.. err..  rocket"<p>[This message has been edited by p4n1c (edited 06-03-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Nashco||06-03-2001||02:26 PM||||How 'bout rather than just slinging sh1t at people whenever you feel like, you don't sling sh1t at all?<P>Everybody just needs to chill out.  Pretend how you act here is just like in real life.  If you overhear somebody say something really dumb at a show, you usually just chuckle, walk away, and forget about it.  There's no need to have any attitude about anything in the first place.<P>This world has enough stress, sorrow, and stupidity as it is; why don't we do a favor to each other and act like adults who can just have a good time?  Smile more often, enjoy things on purpose, and if somebody says something that pisses you off, take the higher road and realize they're only saying it because they don't treat people online like they treat people in person.  And if they do treat people like that in person, you wouldn't even waste your time with them in real life, so that's even more reason to ignore it.<P>Going to court sucks, lawsuits suck worse, and the stress involved with both of the above is the worst.  Save yourself some trouble and just chill out (Ya, I'm talking to all of you who've ever mentioned anything about filing a lawsuit or have got slanderous at somebody on here).  We all have a common interest, so let's focus on that.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Smile, it's a beautiful day <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<P>||||reg||1
